# Lempi fleet time, on the fleet's own time server [GDE-ECHO-300]. The other
# nodes prefer this machine; it takes its own time from the same fallback
# every node has, so a WAN source that wanders moves the whole fleet
# together. Both are non-leap-smearing.
pool us.pool.ntp.org iburst maxsources 3
server time.nist.gov iburst
